WEBVTT

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:18.240
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:18.240
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:24.290
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:24.290
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:41.060
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:41.060
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:46.060
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:46.060
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:51.280
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:51.280
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:56.450
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:56.450
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:56.610 --> 00:01:01.870
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:00:56.610 --> 00:01:01.870
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:07.670
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:07.670
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:12.670
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:12.670
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.640
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.640
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:28.440
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:28.440
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:34.280
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:34.280
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:41.490
<i>Koshiro and the others
face a new challenge</i>

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:45.450
<i>as they come across
their first enemy, Algomon.</i>

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:52.000
<i>Meanwhile, Taichi's side was chasing
the Digitama of the Holy Digimon</i>

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:54.420
<i>which was stolen by Skullknightmon.</i>

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:59.930
<i>To counter the attacks
of the miasma beast, Splashmon,</i>

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:03.260
<i>Metalgreymon's injured arm
became a new weapon.</i>

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:06.270
<i>And with it, they grasped victory.</i>

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:13.770
<i>Then, through the doors opened by Takeru,</i>

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:17.280
<i>Taichi's group stepped foot
inside the enemy's castle.</i>

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:23.780
What a creepy place.

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:26.540
Feels like something could attack
at any moment.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:31.290
But as long as I'm with you, Taichi,
we have nothing to worry about!

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:32.500
Yeah!

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.300
By the way...

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:38.880
The Holy Digimon
was originally held captive here,

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:43.180
and Devimon brought the Digitama
back here again.

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:45.350
What's their objective?

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:49.850
Oh, which way do we go?

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:55.730
This way!

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:56.860
Takeru?!

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:05.580
THE UNBEATABLE BLUE SAGITTARIUS

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:11.500
How do you know it's this way?

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:14.340
A voice is calling me.

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:16.250
A voice?

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:21.680
Remember that incident that happened
before the power failure in Tokyo?

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:24.350
<i>When the trains wouldn't stop.</i>

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:30.430
I've been hearing
someone calling me since then.

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:34.150
Takeru, how did you come to this world?

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:37.190
I don't really know myself.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:39.610
I was at home one night...

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.450
Then...

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:48.290
<i>I saw Yamato, Taichi-san,
and Digimon fighting.</i>

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:52.120
I don't remember much after that,

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.920
but when I woke up...

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:56.340
You could see us?

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:59.000
The Holy Digimon we've been looking for...

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:03.220
I can't believe Yamato's brother
turned out to be the partner.

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:13.480
Chikurimon!

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:14.400
CHIKURIMON

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:19.690
Gabumon!

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:24.360
I'm happy to finally meet the Takeru
that Yamato's been longing to see!

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:26.570
Gabumon...

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:31.660
Until you reunite with the Holy Digimon,
I'm gonna protect you!

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:35.120
Here they come!

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.330
Agumon!

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:38.380
Yeah!

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:44.220
<i>At approximately 12 p.m. JST today,
several tankers in the Strait of Malacca</i>

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:47.590
<i>fell into a mysterious,
uncontrollable state.</i>

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:50.810
<i>If this situation continues,</i>

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:55.940
<i>there is a possibility these vessels may
crash into the Port of Singapore.</i>

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:58.020
Everyone, do your best!

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:01.280
At this rate,
the ships will crash into the city!

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:04.610
But these Algomon just keep coming!

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:06.030
This is endless!

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.040
Petit Thunder!

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:20.040
We can't let Algomon evolve any further!

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:20.960
Tentomon!

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.090
<i>Right!</i>

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:23.050
Piyomon too!

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.050
<i>Okay!</i>

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:27.720
Tentomon Evolution!

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:29.510
Kabuterimon!

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:33.470
Piyomon Evolution!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:35.520
Birdramon!

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:37.190
Here we go!

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:38.060
Yes!

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:39.520
Mega Blaster!

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:41.820
Meteor Wing!

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:48.950
We need do something about that fast!

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.200
Oh!

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:54.200
Another ship has been taken over!

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.830
We don't have enough manpower!

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:29.200
Stop!

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.200
Taichi!

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:36.910
I sense the same thing as the dark swamp
from that hole, no, something worse!

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.710
A well of... miasma?!

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:44.750
The shaded, deep altar,
filled with darkness...

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:46.840
Devimon!

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:51.550
You have no way to resist at this point,
Holy Digimon...

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:58.480
That innocent form shall now be steeped
in darkness and fall into darkness.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:00.770
Oh, no...

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:03.980
To turn the Holy Digimon
into a Dark Digimon...

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:05.940
So that was your plan!

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:07.230
Takeru!

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:12.990
The one called upon by the Holy Digimon...

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:16.620
The sacrifice required by this ceremony...

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:22.080
This death and despair will give birth
to an even deeper darkness.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:30.170
You shall not interfere.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:32.970
Agumon!

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:34.180
Gabumon!

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:39.640
Agumon Evolution!

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:47.190
Greymon!

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:52.610
Gabumon Evolution!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:07:59.620
Garurumon!

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:02.750
HURRY! PLEASE!!
-SORA

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.000
Are we still not there?

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:09.880
Well, as you can see,
there is a traffic jam...

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:13.880
Turn there! It's a shortcut!

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:15.340
Oh... yes.

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:18.060
Turn left at the next corner!

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:21.890
Yes. You know your streets well, my lady.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:28.770
Speaking of streets, Genichiro-sama
also knew the city very well.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:34.280
He kindly showed me many roads when
I had just moved from the countryside.

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:36.780
Just please let me get there!

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:36.780
HOLD ON, I'M COMING!!

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:40.540
This is it!

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:49.170
Oh, um! I-I'll take the stairs, yes!

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:50.050
Hup!

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:53.590
Whoops! Th-The stairs!

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:57.680
Just wait, Gomamon! I'm coming right now!

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:02.220
Poison Ivy!

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:12.110
There's tons of data being transferred
from that point to some location!

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:13.070
What?

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:15.070
I'm afraid that location...

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:19.660
<i>is the Digital World.</i>

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:24.580
Isn't that...

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:30.460
<i>Like how that fake Tokyo's Digimon evolved
using data stolen from our world...</i>

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:37.930
<i>Maybe something unimaginable like that
is about to happen.</i>

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:02.410
Garurumon!

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:03.490
Greymon!

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:06.120
Mega Flame!

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:25.140
Garurumon!

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:26.390
Greymon!

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:28.060
That power...

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:30.150
But we can't lose!

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:34.320
We have to take back
the Holy Digimon no matter what!

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:37.570
Greymon!

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:38.650
Yeah!

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:41.490
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:44.410
Metalgreymon!

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:47.410
Garurumon Super Evolution!

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:51.670
Weregarurumon!

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:56.090
Trident Arm!

00:10:57.840 --> 00:10:59.470
Kaiser Nail!

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:12.980
<i>Devimon...</i>

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:16.730
Very well.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:22.280
What?!

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:30.080
Skullknightmon Super Evolution.

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:41.430
Darkknightmon.

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:43.140
DARKKNIGHTMON

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:45.890
An evolution?!

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:48.140
Darkknightmon...

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:08.950
Takeru!

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:12.210
Weregarurumon...

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:15.580
I told you...
I'm gonna protect you, Takeru!

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:17.340
Metalgreymon!

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.130
Giga Storm!

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:28.010
Trident Arm!

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:04.340
Move!

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:11.220
The Holy Digimon will fall to darkness.

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:13.520
No!

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:16.190
I'm being called...

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:20.230
I swear... I'm gonna...
save the Holy Digimon!

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:22.320
Takeru...

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:26.700
Light will turn to darkness.

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:30.280
Hope is soon to be steeped in despair.

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:34.660
You can't do that!

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:37.920
I won't... give up!

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:06.150
The tankers are going to crash!

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:07.780
There's no time left!

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:09.530
Hey!

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:10.910
Joe Senpai!

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.450
Sorry for the wait!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:13.830
Mimi-san too!

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:16.660
<i>Gomamon! Sorry I'm late!</i>

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:18.210
Joe!

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:20.210
<i>Palmon, you okay?!</i>

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:23.670
<i>Mimi! You came!</i>

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:25.510
<i>I've been waiting, Joe!</i>

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:28.050
Palmon Evolution!

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:30.180
Gomamon Evolution!

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:31.390
Togemon!

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:33.140
Ikkakumon!

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:43.940
Calamaramon vanished...

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:47.070
We won... right?

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.780
Problem solved then!

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:55.910
Trident Arm!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:02.580
I won't let you touch Takeru!

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.190
Kaiser Nail!

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:23.940
Weregarurumon!

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:25.690
Go, Yamato!

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:27.150
Thanks!

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:40.620
Oh!

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:42.120
Wait!

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:56.850
Yamato!

00:15:57.010 --> 00:15:59.350
You did good, Takeru!

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:00.480
Let's pull it up!

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:01.690
Okay!

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:17.910
Metalgreymon!

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.830
If it could've been helped...

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:29.460
If it could've been helped,
I'd rather not have dragged you into this.

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:35.260
I found out that you guys...
the Digimon...

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:42.020
<i>are all fighting hard
to save lots of people.</i>

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:45.770
That's why I thought,

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:49.570
"I want to fight along with you guys...

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:51.820
with Digimon too!"

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:55.490
Just like you and Weregarurumon!

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:57.370
Takeru...

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:34.110
Yamato!

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.320
Takeru!

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:37.950
Yamato!

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:41.910
I'm all right!
You just hang onto the Digitama!

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:42.830
Okay!

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:47.750
Yamato...

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:49.840
Takeru...

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:54.130
I won't... give up!

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:01.890
I won't... give up either!

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:10.400
Weregarurumon?

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:43.470
We're flying!

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:45.140
Weregarurumon?

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:47.690
You okay? Both of you?

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:49.900
Thank you!

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:53.270
Yamato! Takeru!

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:55.610
The Digitama's safe!

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:58.400
Takeru, way to go!

00:18:58.570 --> 00:18:59.610
Look out!

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:04.740
You shall not take... the Digitama!

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.800
You're...

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:07.720
POYOMON

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:27.870
Takeru?

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:29.700
That Digimon...

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:32.290
The Holy Digimon hatched!

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:34.040
You did it, Takeru!

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:35.290
Yeah!

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:37.460
Taichi!

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:39.210
Everyone, watch out!

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:41.050
What's the matter?

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:42.800
I sense an evil presence...

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:44.130
Look!

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:51.680
What is it?!

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:55.350
This feeling... there's no mistake!

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:59.820
Finally, we meet...

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:06.740
Devimon!

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.490
DEVIMON

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:11.250
The Holy Digimon.

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:16.830
My dear... old friend.

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:23.800
This is the salvation I give you...

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:28.100
Fall to darkness.

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:45.610
<i>Why do these held hands</i>

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:45.610
<i>naze ima kono te to te nigitte</i>

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:48.280
<i>And the warmth exchanged</i>

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:48.280
<i>tashikameta taion wo</i>

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:50.740
<i>Make me reminisce now</i>

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:50.740
<i>natsukashiku omou noka</i>

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:56.330
<i>Why an abyss dancing with endless rain</i>

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:56.330
<i>naze samidare no susabu shinen</i>

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:58.830
<i>The gaze of that smile</i>

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:58.830
<i>hohoenda sono shisen ni</i>

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:00.210
<i>Makes me want to cry</i>

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:00.210
<i>nakitaku naru</i>

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:03.130
<i>So call me with that voice</i>

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:03.130
<i>sono koe de boku wo yonde kure</i>

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:05.300
<i>This weakness I cannot tell others</i>

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:05.300
<i>dare ni ienu kono yowasa ga</i>

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:08.390
<i>I realize is my pillar to stand firm</i>

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:08.390
<i>tsuyoku tatsu tame no jiku dato omoishiru</i>

00:22:08.550 --> 00:22:10.680
<i>Difference is what makes me adore you</i>

00:22:08.550 --> 00:22:10.680
<i>chigau kara itooshiku naru</i>

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:13.640
<i>I just want to understand you and me</i>

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:13.640
<i>tada wakaritai kimi to boku wo</i>

00:22:13.810 --> 00:22:15.850
<i>Scars grow the more we live</i>

00:22:13.810 --> 00:22:15.850
<i>ikiru hodo kizu ga fuete iku</i>

00:22:16.020 --> 00:22:19.100
<i>But still we seek the reasons for us</i>

00:22:16.020 --> 00:22:19.100
<i>sore demo sagashiteiru bokura no wake wo</i>

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:21.360
<i>Overlaying them makes us beautiful</i>

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:21.360
<i>kasanete wa utsukushiku naru</i>

00:22:21.520 --> 00:22:25.280
<i>I want to know now, I want to cry out</i>

00:22:21.520 --> 00:22:25.280
<i>ima wakaritai sakebi dashitai</i>

00:22:31.580 --> 00:22:33.160
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.620 --> 00:22:35.830
<i>Weregarurumon.</i>

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:38.290
<i>This Digimon super evolves from Garurumon.</i>

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:38.290
LEVEL: ULTIMATE

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:40.880
TYPE: BEAST MAN

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:43.000
<i>The Kaiser Nail attack uses sharp claws
to slash the enemy!</i>

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:43.420
SPECIAL MOVE: KAISER NAIL

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:45.630
<i>Today, we'll do a fashion check!</i>

00:22:45.800 --> 00:22:48.050
<i>Earrings, bangles, and ripped jeans!</i>

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:51.140
<i>Weregarurumon dresses
in a rather wild but cool fashion.</i>

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:55.180
<i>Maybe adding a vest would make it classy
and even more stylish?</i>

00:22:57.940 --> 00:23:00.100
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:02.060 --> 00:23:05.900
<i>Devimon's next evolution
puts Taichi and the others in peril!</i>

00:23:06.070 --> 00:23:08.570
<i>Will Koshiro's clever plan
make it in time?!</i>

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:12.070
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Messenger of Darkness, Devimon"</i>

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:14.660
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
